      "writtenOn": "2025-08-20T18:10:44Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "That does not make sense; the parameter `const tA2DP_SBC_CIE* p_ie` of `A2DP_BuildInfoSbc` is const already.\n\nBut I do see that you have added a call to A2DP_AdjustBitpool that mutates the input parameters. This is where the compilation error is.",
