        "id": 1971855
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-08-21T08:28:07Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "Since we want to alter the value of p_ie,\nwhat if we do something like this:\n\nIn A2DP_BuildInfoSbc:\n\n// Create a temporary variable p_ie_temp\ntA2DP_SBC_CIE p_ie_temp \u003d *p_ie;\n//Make adjustments in p_ie_temp\nA2DP_AdjustBitpool(\u0026p_ie_temp);\n\nUse those changes in p_ie_temp to update p_result.\nUsing above approach, we can retain const specifier too.\n\nPlease let me know your thoughts.",
      "parentUuid": "c53a3aaa_b015313b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 67,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 67,
        "endChar": 12
